# Copy to .dev.vars. These reach the Worker's own environment (bindings and
# secrets), which is not the same place as .env.local — that one holds the
# Clerk keys the app is built with (see .env.example).
#
# The signing secret of the Clerk webhook endpoint that sends `user.deleted`,
# from the Clerk dashboard. In production it is a wrangler secret:
#   pnpm --filter @crazy/web exec wrangler secret put CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# Leave it out and POST /webhooks/clerk refuses every request, which is the
# point: an endpoint that cannot tell Clerk from anyone else deletes nothing.
CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
